OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a mostly dry and
OL,6,Fcloudy day with bright or sunny spells
OL,7,Fbreaking through. The odd shower
OL,8,Fpossible but these mainly around
OL,9,Fnorthern coasts.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will be a dry evening with
OL,12,Fclear spells. Remaining dry and mostly
OL,13,Fcloudy overnight with some clearer
OL,14,Fintervals. Light winds but becoming
OL,15,Fbreezier around the coasts.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FIt will be a mostly dry and
OL,18,Fcloudy day but with some bright
OL,19,Fintervals breaking through. Outbreaks
OL,20,Fof rain spreading east in the evening.
OL,21,FWindy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
